  "How are cut-heavy and drive-heavy shapers classified from play-type records without the classification depending on the outcome?",
  "Does the 2025-26 partial data create leakage or drift when compared with complete 2022-23 to 2024-25 seasons?"
 ],
 "historical_evidence": [
  {
   "id": "FAM:SF29",
   "status_as_recorded": "rejected",
   "finding": "Confirmatory test that lineups covering all three core roles score more per possession net of role counts and talent. Recorded result: M1 COVERED b=+0.0067 (+0.67 pts/100), t=1.35, p=0.176, CI[-0.28,+1.65]; a later final run recorded beta=+0.42 pts/100, p=0.595, MDE80=2.19 pts/100. Failure mechanism recorded as B_powered_null (adequately powered null). Sample: 72 team-seasons in both strata."
