  },
  {
   "id": "FAM:SF-PAP-032",
   "status_as_recorded": "inconclusive",
   "finding": "Travel x fit quadrant screen against post-move minutes, usage and destination net rating, n=198 movers. Recorded: corr(delta, dest_net)=+0.077; fit_score correlations negative; net-rating gap between additive and irrelevant quadrants large but the recorded failure mechanism is E_unclear, with in-sample thresholds noted."
